            "state": "translated",
            "value": "302 跳轉"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "4. 回到本页，状态变为「已安装并完全信任」即可开启 HTTPS 解密。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. Come back here; once the status shows “Installed and fully trusted” you can turn on HTTPS decryption."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. 回到本頁，狀態變為「已安裝並完全信任」即可開啟 HTTPS 解密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
