    "HTTP 明文请求无需 MitM 即可重写；HTTPS 需要在 MitM 页添加主机名并信任证书。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plain HTTP requests can be rewritten without MitM; HTTPS needs the host name on the MitM page and a trusted certificate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTP 明文請求無需 MitM 即可重寫；HTTPS 需要在 MitM 頁新增主機名並信任證書。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
