        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取舍：更省电、内存更低；但不遵守系统代理的 App（很多游戏、部分即时通讯、所有 UDP / QUIC）会直连；DNS 由系统解析，按 IP 的规则与 Fake-IP 不生效；MitM 只对走代理的 HTTPS 生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trade-off: saves battery and memory, but apps that ignore the system proxy (many games, some messengers, all UDP / QUIC) connect directly; DNS is resolved by the system, so IP rules and Fake-IP don't apply; MitM only works for HTTPS that goes through the proxy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取捨：更省電、記憶體更低；但不遵守系統代理的 App（很多遊戲、部分即時通訊、所有 UDP / QUIC）會直連；DNS 由系統解析，按 IP 的規則與 Fake-IP 不生效；MitM 只對走代理的 HTTPS 生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只解密下方主机名列表（含已启用模块）中的 HTTPS 流量；QUIC/HTTP3 会被阻断以回落到 TCP。证书固定（pinning）的 App 握手失败后会自动放行 30 分钟。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only HTTPS traffic to the host names below (including enabled modules) is decrypted; QUIC/HTTP3 is blocked so apps fall back to TCP. Apps with certificate pinning fail the handshake and are passed through for 30 minutes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只解密下方主機名列表（含已啟用模組）中的 HTTPS 流量；QUIC/HTTP3 會被阻斷以回落到 TCP。證書固定（pinning）的 App 握手失敗後會自動放行 30 分鐘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只设置系统 HTTP / HTTPS 代理（指向本机 %lld 端口），不接管路由和 DNS。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only sets the system HTTP / HTTPS proxy (local port %lld); routes and DNS are not taken over."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只設定系統 HTTP / HTTPS 代理（指向本機 %lld 埠），不接管路由和 DNS。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
