    },
    "所有格式的模块都在这里：Surge .sgmodule、Quantumult X 重写片段、Loon .plugin、Stash .stoverride 和重写列表，角标显示来源格式。模块 [Rule] 中的策略名会对应到当前配置的策略组，找不到时可在模块详情里指定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modules of every format live here: Surge .sgmodule, Quantumult X rewrite snippets, Loon .plugin, Stash .stoverride and rewrite lists, with a badge for the source format. Policy names in a module's [Rule] map to groups of the current profile; if one is missing you can choose it in the module details."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有格式的模組都在這裡：Surge .sgmodule、Quantumult X 重寫片段、Loon .plugin、Stash .stoverride 和重寫列表，角標顯示來源格式。模組 [Rule] 中的策略名會對應到當前配置的策略組，找不到時可在模組詳情裡指定。"
          }
        }
      }
