    "由系统在网络变化时自动连接：「始终」任何网络都连接；「仅 Wi-Fi」在蜂窝网络下断开；「仅蜂窝网络」在 Wi-Fi 下断开。在 App 里手动断开会暂停按需连接，直到你再次手动连接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The system connects automatically when the network changes: “Always” on any network; “Wi-Fi Only” disconnects on cellular; “Cellular Only” disconnects on Wi-Fi. Disconnecting manually in the app pauses on-demand until you connect manually again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由系統在網路變化時自動連線：「始終」任何網路都連線；「僅 Wi-Fi」在蜂窩網路下斷開；「僅蜂窩網路」在 Wi-Fi 下斷開。在 App 裡手動斷開會暫停按需連線，直到你再次手動連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
