    "策略名会对应到当前配置的策略组；找不到时使用第一个手动选择组并标黄。远程列表通过内核下载并转换为 mihomo 规则集；QX filter_remote 没有 force-policy 时整份列表走 proxy（第一个手动选择组）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Policy names map to groups of the current profile; when missing, the first manual select group is used and highlighted. Remote lists are downloaded by the core and converted to mihomo rule sets; a QX filter_remote without force-policy sends the whole list to proxy (the first manual select group)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "策略名會對應到當前配置的策略組；找不到時使用第一個手動選擇組並標黃。遠端列表透過核心下載並轉換為 mihomo 規則集；QX filter_remote 沒有 force-policy 時整份列表走 proxy（第一個手動選擇組）。"
          }
        }
      }
