        }
      }
    },
    "重放经内核按你的规则与策略发出，不再经过重写与脚本；结果也会出现在请求列表里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Replays go out through the core with your rules and policies, without rewrites or scripts; the result also appears in the request list."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重放經核心按你的規則與策略發出，不再經過重寫與指令碼；結果也會出現在請求列表裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
