    "重新生成证书？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regenerate the certificate?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新生成證書？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重签名后描述文件会替换 entitlements。App 与扩展会在运行时从描述文件读取 App Group 并按字母序选第一个可用的；共享容器不可用时扩展无法读取配置，连接会失败。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Re-signing replaces the entitlements from the provisioning profile. The app and the extension read the App Group from the profile at runtime and use the first usable one in alphabetical order; if the shared container is unavailable the extension can't read the profile and connecting fails."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重簽名後描述檔案會替換 entitlements。App 與擴充套件會在執行時從描述檔案讀取 App Group 並按字母序選第一個可用的；共享容器不可用時擴充套件無法讀取配置，連線會失敗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
